./" Manpage for mvvi
.TH man 1 "26 August 2025" "1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
	mvvi - mv a file then edit it in vim
.SH SYNOPSIS
	mvvi source destination
.SH DESCRIPTION
	does mv then edits the file in vim
.SH OPTIONS
	mv default options work, so -i to prompt before overwrite, -n to not overwrite, -b to make backups, -u for update, -v for verbose
.br
	vim default options do not work
.SH EXAMPLES
	mvvi hi.csv csvs
.br
	mvvi sdifji.py ../../ijsdif/jsissbsbbsb.py
.br
	mvvi 1.txt 2.txt
.SH BUGS
	probably none
